{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>These are the generations of the heavens and the earth when they were created.</b> These plants and living creatures that we have mentioned were the generations of the heavens and the earth in the potentiality found in them from the moment they were created, for from then on there were found in them active and passive powers for the coming-to-be of generated and perishable things, as they said: אֶת הַשָּׁמַיִם to include their generations, וְאֶת הָאָרֶץ to include its generations — only they had not yet emerged into actuality." "<b>In the day that YHWH Elohim made earth and heavens.</b> On the day He arranged the governance of the earth and its generations from the heavens in a constant order — and this was after the six days of Genesis. Then He was called YHWH Elohim, for through His constant order all existence comes to be."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:39.242866951Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}